    <preface>
      <p>Treasury Laws Amendment (Accelerated Depreciation for Small Business Entities) Act 2018</p>
      <p>No. 109, 2018</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the law relating to taxation, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1	Short title	1</p>
      <p>2	Commencement	2</p>
      <p>3	Schedules	2</p>
      <p>Schedule 1—Amendments	3</p>
      <p>Income Tax Assessment Act 1997	3</p>
